 `resolvePointer(document, pointer)` resolves values using [RFC 6901 JSON Pointer](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6901).
 It returns the input document for the empty pointer, decodes `~0` and `~1` in reference tokens, and throws when the pointer is invalid or cannot be resolved.
+
+## JSON Patch
+
+`applyPatch(document, patch)` applies an [RFC 6902 JSON Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6902) containing
+`add`, `remove`, `replace`, `move`, `copy`, and `test` operations. It validates the patch and JSON values, returns a
+new document without mutating the input, and throws if an operation cannot be applied.
